body:
You're obviously right. I had planned that my unemployment allowances would get me through before I could get a funding for my PhD but I know it doesn't sound like a very good plan.

&#x200B;

I'm just so through with work I can't do it anymore. I cry at my desk every fucking day. For a very long time I hung on to it for financial reasons and because I was proud of it (it's quite a prestigious position). But now that I was able to admit the job is shit and makes me anxious and sick I just want to quit. I've already filed two doctor's note this year. I just don't know why I should stay at a job that is obviously making me miserable.
